Modifications for Piotr Voice Hub (continuous-mode listening, cue
api.respond, play_follow_up_ready_cue, removal of on-device wake word and
Home Assistant timers) are part of this project.

The vendored WAV files in sounds/ (message_end.wav, follow_up_listening.wav,
conversation_timeout.wav) were copied from piotr_the_ai_server
firmware/esphome/sounds/ (first committed there as 7a046b3, 2026-05-26).
They are short project cue clips, not from the Home Assistant Voice PE
sound set (those remain referenced from the 26.4.0 tag). No separate
third-party licence was found for the WAV files.
